msgid "High-precision unit conversion for students and professionals. Convert hundreds of units instantly."
msgstr "Konversi unit presisi tinggi untuk pelajar dan profesional. Konversikan ratusan unit secara instan."

#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:2542
msgid "Highway efficiency depends on speed. Comparing a US road trip logged in mph with a European test cycle talked about in km/h needs speed conversion so you compare similar driving, not just similar labels."
msgstr ""

